# variants/kits/graphics/desktop-int — desktop integration: tray, gestures, XDG dirs and portals
#
# LEAF set: a flat list of atoms (2026-09-09). See kits/core/base for the layering contract.
# gui-apps/mako: a Wayland notification daemon. libnotify needs one
# (virtual/notification-daemon), and without a desktop USE the virtual's first
# choice is x11-misc/notification-daemon, which requires gtk+[X] -- an X-only
# daemon on a Wayland desktop. kde and gnome switch the virtual to their own
# (plasma-workspace, gnome-shell) when their USE arrives (2026-09-26).

dev-libs/libayatana-appindicator-glib
gui-apps/mako
sys-apps/xdg-desktop-portal
x11-misc/libinput-gestures
x11-misc/xdg-user-dirs
